        if (!available.contains(ref.name)) {
            String message = "The method `" + ref.name + "` is not a public method that takes a `View` parameter in the activity context";
            context.report(ISSUE, ref.location, message);
        }
    }
}
```

resolveContextClass:
```
@Nullable
private static String resolveContextClass(@NonNull String raw, @NonNull Context context) {
    String name = raw.trim();
    if (name.isEmpty()) return null;
    String pkg = context.getMainProject().getPackage();
    if (name.startsWith(".")) {
        if (pkg != null && !pkg.isEmpty()) {
            return pkg + name;
        } else {
            return name.substring(1);
        }
    } else if (pkg != null && !pkg.isEmpty() && !name.contains(".")) {
        return pkg + "." + name;
    }
    return name;
}
```
